# Equipment & Facility Work Order (shared module)

Paper forms (for **PDF download only**):

| Form | Code | Use |
|------|------|-----|
| Equipment & Facility Work Order | **FEN-001-01-B** | Download PDF from log |
| Work Order Issuance Log | **FEN-001-01-A** | Engineering issuance log PDF |
| Facility Interior Maintenance Monthly Checklist | **FEN-001-01-C** | Engineering — Area WOs only |
| Facility Exterior Maintenance Monthly Checklist | **FEN-001-01-D** | Engineering — Area WOs only |

WI: **WI-EN-001-01**. Effective date on PDF header: **MAY 06 2025**. Revision: **00**.

**One module for all departments** (`/equipment-work-order`). Do **not** copy under `qa/`, `purchase/`, etc.

## Critical: UI vs PDF

| Surface | Look |
|---------|------|
| **On-screen forms / logs** | Normal Medicap `wof` tables — **do not** restyle screens to look like scanned paper |
| **Download Issuance Log** PDF | Exact paper **FEN-001-01-A** (logo, control header, 5 columns) |
| **Download Form B** PDF | Exact paper **FEN-001-01-B** |

Logo for PDF: `phpmedicap/logos/medicap-logo.png`.

## Screens (no “Part A/B/C” in UI titles)

